sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant F as Finder
  participant DM as DragMonitor
  participant W as WheelPanel
  participant Q as JobQueue
  participant E as Engine
  participant O as OutputWriter
  participant H as HUD
  U->>F: start dragging kyoto-trip.heic
  F-->>DM: drag pasteboard changeCount++
  DM->>DM: read file URLs, start polling modifiers
  U->>DM: tap ⇧
  DM->>W: show conversion wheel at cursor (7 targets)
  U->>W: hover PNG petal
  W-->>U: highlight + centre "PNG" + tick + AX announcement
  U->>W: drop
  W->>Q: enqueue(convert, [heic URL], png)
  Q->>H: show "Converting to PNG"
  Q->>E: ImageIO decode HEIC → encode PNG (temp file)
  E-->>Q: progress / done
  Q->>O: move temp → "kyoto-trip.png" (or "kyoto-trip 2.png")
  O->>F: reveal + select new file
  Q->>H: "Saved kyoto-trip.png" (auto-dismiss)
